:"I dig this place. A lot. The location is ideal if you're talking a walk around the Garden District or in transit between the CBD and Uptown. I didn't get to try any of the hot specialty food, but from the looks of it, I'd like to! Stop in for a drink, be it coffee or their homemade teas, and stay for the free library, not-too-loud music, and cutesy decor. Oh, and the friendliest baristas on the block! You can't be a coffee shop like Reservoir!"},{"business_id":"7Fqf5nkKkVhXn_DUrPWWEA","review_id":"cIa9YRoNBNt7-z3RS6uHWw","date":"2014-05-29T03:45:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9216656684875488,"text_excerpt":"We were on a stroll through the Garden District on a very hot day, in need of cold beverages (and air conditioning). We found this place by chance...the old fashioned way. My guy got a coffee shake and it was divine. Thick and creamy...and coffee-ey. Mmm. I ordered an iced chai; they make their own chai blend and it was tasty! I enjoyed that very much. The shop is trendy. Lots of interesting artwork. Excellent people-watching. Functioning a/c (yes!). Great coffee-style beverages. Definitely a fan."},{"business_id":"7Fqf5nkKkVhXn_DUrPWWEA","review_id":"3gLJO6q91yYJZwSGKpEUlg","date":"2013-11-28T01:10:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9122354388237,"text_excerpt":"BREAKFAST. TACOS. y'all. they have breakfast tacos. and delicious coffee. And anyone who knows me, knows I'm (mildy.. hah) obsessed with any kind of tacos, but especially those of the breakfast variety. And they're cheap! Reservoir Cafe sits on magazine street in a on-and-popping area, which also happens to be my neighborhood. There are a good handful of coffee shops within walking distance of this one.. and they've all got their distinct charm and vibe to them. Plus, they're all a little on the smaller side (but local, so win!), so if one is packed, just keep meandering around the area. Chances are it'll be a gorgeous day anyways, and you'll need to walk off the amazing pastries you'll f..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7Fqf5nkKkVhXn_DUrPWWEA","photo_id":"pXagvLNRAU7869oTFEedaw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pXagvLNRAU7869oTFEedaw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9999998807907104}]},"notebook_case":null}
